rows.en:
...Kazama, who'd killed the mood with that pathetic story.
And yet there he was, grinning smugly, as if to say he'd told the scariest story of them all.
{f:This guy really is hopeless.|Honestly, he really is hopeless.}{p}

"Oh, how thoughtful of you, Hino."
With that, Kazama rummaged around in the plastic bag and pulled out what was inside.
There were drinks in it.{p}

Hino glanced at {f:me|me} and grinned.
As if he wanted to tell me not to worry.
{f:I|I} felt somehow embarrassed, as if he'd read my mind, and looked down.{p}

It was pitch-black inside.
There wasn't a single window, and a really nasty smell filled the place.
Yeah, how do I put it...{p}

That settles it.
Everybody, to the science prep room. {g}Let's go!
Don't worry, I've got the keys.{p}

...Look.
That door.
On the other side of that door is a new life-form.{p}

...Hino.
...I can't take any more{f:...|...}
{f:I|I} could feel myself slipping away, too.
What a smell{f:!|!}{p}

It was so dusty in here.
...My eyes were gradually getting used to the dark, but...
Instead, my vision began to warp.
But maybe there isn't even a light switch in this room at all{f:?|?}
{f:This is bad.|What do I do?}
...I'm at my limit{f:.|.}{p}

............{f:I|I} was alive.
But I couldn't move my arms or legs.
{f:Was I tied up?|Was I tied up?}{p}

...I could hear it.
I could hear a baby crying.
It was that crying Hino had told us about{f:.|.}
Where was it coming from{f:...|...}
The crying came from all four sides, as if wrapping itself around {f:me|me}.
...My mind was still hazy.
Somehow, it felt very pleasant.
Somehow, it felt very warm.{p}

...{f:I see|I get it}.
{f:My|My} body was soaking in water{f:.|.}
{f:I|I} was in lukewarm water up to my chest{f:.|.}
Was this... water?
It was so dim around me, and my eyes wouldn't focus, so I couldn't see well.
Now and then a stabbing pain shot through my body, but that, in turn, gave me pleasure.
I couldn't even bring myself to try to think clearly.
...This languid feeling.
I didn't care what happened to me anymore.
...Being alive was too much trouble.
I had no will left for anything{f:.|.}
...What had happened to {f:me|me}{f:?|?}
"...Sir. They're growing nicely, aren't they?"{p}

Piled up there were a great many human arms and legs.
...So {f:that was it|that was it}.
{f:I|I} wasn't tied up{f:.|.}
The reason {f:I|I} couldn't move my arms and legs was that they had been taken off{f:.|.}
Those were {f:my|my} arms and legs...
The carelessly heaped limbs brought to mind the wreckage of broken mannequins.
Iwashita's and Shindo's arms and legs must be in there too, mixed in with {f:mine|mine}{f:.|.}
Strangely, {f:I|I} didn't feel sad.
I think the comfort of soaking in this solution helped with that.
I could feel something entering {f:my|my} body through the wounds where {f:my|my} limbs had been taken.
It spread slowly through my whole body, as if seeping into it.
...And from there, it seemed {f:my|my} new arms and legs were starting to grow{f:.|.}{p}

That orange juice you drank in the newspaper club room.
You remember, right?
There was already a drug in it to numb your senses.{p}

...{f:You're wrong|You're wrong}, Hino.
{f:I've|I've} been reborn as a being that never has to worry about anything{f:.|.}
The ultimate pleasure, which only those who become it can understand.
Too bad, but you'll never get to taste it, Hino.
{f:I|I} don't have to think, and I don't need to move.
I'll just live on through endless time.
The one to be pitied is you, Hino{f:.|.}
...From now on, {f:my|my} new life begins{f:.|.}{p}

{f:I|I} decided to help myself without holding back.
Everyone took whatever they liked.
{f:I|I} chose the tomato juice.
I can't eat raw tomatoes{f:, but|, but} I can drink tomato juice{f:.|.}
It was nicely chilled, so I ended up gulping it all down.
Thanks to that, it was gone right away.
Everyone else still seemed to be savoring theirs, so {f:I|I} was left with nothing to do{f:.|.}
Somehow it was getting even more humid{f:.|.}
It might rain.
I hoped it wouldn't rain before {f:we|we} went home...
{f:I|I} waited for everyone to finish drinking, thinking about that.{p}

...Six students were lying in the club room.
Next to {f:me|me} was Kazama{f:.|.}
I tried to shake him awake, and {f:I|I} gasped.
Kazama's throat had been slashed straight across{f:.|.}
{f:He's dead|He's dead}★
{f:I|I} looked around at everyone.
At that moment, {f:I|I} understood.
This smell filling the whole room...
It was the smell of {f:blood|blood}.
Everyone in this room except {f:me|me} was dead{f:.|.}
Maybe it was the work of the thing that went out just now.
But {f:what|what} was that?
That tail, slimy and coated in mucus like a slug?{p}

But then... how did {f:that thing|that thing} get out{f:?|?}
Someone pounded furiously on the door.
A room locked from the inside, with six dead and one living.
I knew that even if I explained what {f:I|I} saw, no one would believe me.
The trap that had somehow snared {f:me|me} was slowly being pulled tight.
In a sea of blood, all {f:I|I} could do was keep laughing weakly.{p}

Hino looked down and fell silent.
"U-Um... so, what happened to Iwayama?"
{f:I|I} asked without thinking.
With an ending {f:that|that} abrupt, anyone would want to know{f:.|.}
Hino raised his face.{p}

I finally managed to burst outside.
I was worried about what had happened to Iwayama, but there was no way I was going back in there.
So I ran off home.{p}

"See, I told you!
This one's the monster that ate Iwayama!"
I could hear Hino's voice.{p}

{f:No way|No way} am I just going to wait here to get killed!
{f:I|I} fought back.
I swung up the nearest chair.{p}

......There was a sickening crunch.
When I came to my senses, Hino was lying on the floor.
Blood was running from his nose and mouth, and from his ears too.{p}

Someone said that.
But if I hadn't done it, {f:I|I} would have...!
As {f:I|I} turned to make excuses, they backed away as if frightened.
"M-Murderer!"
"Murderer!"
One person's scream set it off, and everyone started running.
They rushed out of the club room.
I could hear them all screaming.
{f:Should I|I had to} run too while I had the chance{f:?|.}
...But where to?
I'd never get away.
{f:I'm|I'm} a murderer{f:.|.}
......But what did {f:I|I} ever do{f:?|?}
All I did was try to collect the seven wonders{f:!|!}
Or... is {f:it|it} because I learned all seven that I'm being punished by someone{f:?|?}
The hallway was getting noisy.
At least, before they caught me, I would have liked to know who was trying to punish me.
...{f:I|I} was idly thinking such things.{p}
